SoltrOS 1 (Electric Blue)
Gaming-ready immutable Fedora desktop with CachyOS performance.

Quick commands:
  soltros install          Install the default application set
  soltros install-gaming   Install gaming applications
  soltros update           Update the system and applications
  soltros help             Show all available commands

Use rpm-ostree for system packages and Flatpak or Distrobox for applications.
